# Cloudflare Pages Edge Caching Headers
/assets/images/gallery/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

/assets/video/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  Accept-Ranges: bytes

/assets/vectors/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
